        // to change the joint state of the two qubits to one of the following four states
        // based on the value of message:
        // [0; 0]:    |Φ⁺⟩ = (|00⟩ + |11⟩) / sqrt(2)
        // [0; 1]:    |Ψ⁺⟩ = (|01⟩ + |10⟩) / sqrt(2)
        // [1; 0]:    |Φ⁻⟩ = (|00⟩ - |11⟩) / sqrt(2)
        // [1; 1]:    |Ψ⁻⟩ = (|01⟩ - |10⟩) / sqrt(2)

        if message::Bit1 { // accesses the item 'Bit1' of 'message'
            // ...
